# Coldline
# File: .gitattributes
# Component: Git text policy
# Purpose: Keep text line endings stable across Windows and Linux.
# Interacts With: Git checkout and CI
# Sprint/Task: Sprint 2 — Task 2.6
# Concepts: Cross-platform reproducibility
